        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Tunicamycin is mixture of homologous nucleoside antibiotics that block the reaction of UDP-N-acetylglucosamine and dolichyl phosphate in the first step of glycoprotein synthesis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
