        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Doxycycline is second generation semi-synthetic derivative of the tetracycline group of antibiotics. It inhibits bacterial protein synthesis by binding to the 30S subunit of the bacterial ribosome and preventing the aminotransferase-tRNA from associating with the ribosome.</owl:annotatedTarget>
