        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">VanS is similar to histidine protein kinases like EnvZ and acts as a response regulator by activating VanR. VanS is required for high level transcription of other van glycopeptide resistance genes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
