        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Tylosin is a 16-membered macrolide, naturally produced by Streptomyces fradiae. It interacts with the bacterial ribosome 50S subunit to inhibit protein synthesis.</owl:annotatedTarget>
