        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Spiramycin is a 16-membered macrolide and is natural product produced by Streptomyces ambofaciens. It binds to the 50S subunit of bacterial ribosomes and inhibits peptidyl transfer activity to disrupt protein synthesis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
