        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Rifamycin antibiotics are a group of broad-spectrum ansamycin antibiotics that inhibit bacterial RNA polymerase by binding to a highly conserved region, blocking the oligonucleotide exit tunnel, and preventing the extension of nascent mRNAs.</owl:annotatedTarget>
