        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Confers low vancomycin resistance by engineering peptidoglycan precursors ending in D-Ala-D-Ser in an inducible or constitutive manner.  The vanC cluster is intrinsic to the Enterococcus gallinarum chromosome. vanC organisms remain susceptible to teicoplanin. Gene orientation: vanC(XY)TRS.</owl:annotatedTarget>
