        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">EmrAB-TolC is a multidrug efflux system found in E. coli. EmrB is the electrochemical-gradient powered transporter; EmrA is the linker; and TolC is the outer membrane channel. It confers resistance to nalidixic acid and thiolactomycin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
