        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">In the presence of ATP and magnesium (II), fosfomycin gets phosphorylated at the phosphate group resulting in a diphosphate group which inactivates the antibiotic.</obo:IAO_0000115>
