        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Alternate proteins that have the same functions as other antibiotic target proteins, but are structurally different and thus resistant to antibiotics. These can replace the activity of other antibiotic-sensitive proteins in the presence of antibiotics.</obo:IAO_0000115>
