        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">NorB is a multidrug efflux pump in Staphylococcus aureus that confers resistance to fluoroquinolones and other structurally unrelated antibiotics like tetracycline. It shares 30% similarity with NorB, and is a structural homolog of Blt of Bacillus subtilis. It is regulated by mgrA, also known as NorR.</obo:IAO_0000115>
