        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Fluoroquinolones inhibit type II and type IV topoisomerases (2 strand breaking enzymes) such as GyrA/GyrB and ParC/ParE. Point mutations in the associated gyrA and parC genes, in particular in the &apos;quinolone resistance determining region&apos; (QRDR), give rise to resistance to the class.</obo:IAO_0000115>
