        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">OleI and OleD are glycosyltransferases found in Streptomyces antibioticus which is a natural producer of antibiotic oleandomycin. OleI glycosylates antibiotic oleandomycin whereas OleD can glycosylate a wide variety of macrolides.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
