        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Metallo-beta-lactamases of subclass B3 are similar to B1 in that they have activity against penicillins, cephalosporins and carbapenems; however, the are only active with two Zn(II) ions in the active site.</obo:IAO_0000115>
