        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Pristinamycin IA is a type B streptogramin antibiotic produced by Streptomyces pristinaespiralis. It binds to the P site of the 50S subunit of the bacterial ribosome, preventing the extension of protein chains.</obo:IAO_0000115>
