        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Bacitracin A is the primary component of bacitracin. It contains many uncommon amino acids and interferes with bacterial cell wall synthesis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
