        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Phenoxymethylpenicillin, or penicillin V, is a penicillin derivative that is acid stable but less active than benzylpenicillin (penicillin G).</obo:IAO_0000115>
