        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Azlocillin is a semisynthetic derivative of penicillin that is notably active against Ps. aeruginosa and other Gram-negative bacteria.</obo:IAO_0000115>
