        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Cefalexin is a cephalosporin antibiotic that causes filamentation. It is resistant to staphylococcal beta-lactamase, but degraded by enterobacterial beta-lactamases.</obo:IAO_0000115>
