        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Actinomycins are peptide antibiotics that interact with DNA. This prevents RNA synthesis, thus preventing the production of proteins vital to the cell.</obo:IAO_0000115>
