        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Arabinofuranosyltransferases allow for the polymerization of arabinose to form arabinan. Arabanan is required for formation of mycobacterial cell walls.</obo:IAO_0000115>
