        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The P-site of the ribosome binds the peptidyl-tRNA with the growing polypeptide chain. Antibiotics that target the P-site block fMet-tRNA from entering, thus inhibiting peptide elongation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
