        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">PatA-PatB is an efflux protein complex that is associated with fluoroquinolone resistance in Streptococcus pneumoniae. Experiments indicate that PatA and PatB form a heterodimeric transporter.</obo:IAO_0000115>
