        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">AdeABC is an RND multidrug efflux system in Acinetobacter species, notably A. baunmannii. AdeA is a membrane fusion protein, AdeB is the inner membrane transporter, and AdeC is the outer membrane factor. It confers resistance to tigecycline.</obo:IAO_0000115>
