        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">SoxRS is a two-component regulator part of the superoxide stress response. It is a positive regulator for many multidrug efflux pumps.</obo:IAO_0000115>
