        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">BaeS is a sensor kinase in the BaeSR regulatory system. While it phosphorylates BaeR to increase its activity, BaeS is not necessary for overexpressed BaeR to confer resistance.</obo:IAO_0000115>
