        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CpxA is a membrane-localized sensor kinase that is activated by envelope stress. It starts a kinase cascade that activates CpxR, which promotes efflux complex expression.</obo:IAO_0000115>
