        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">L-681217 is a kirromycin-like antibiotic produced by Streptomyces cattleya. Its biosynthetic gene cluster is characterized.</obo:IAO_0000115>
