        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Heneicomycin is a kirromycin-like antibiotic, isolated from Streptomyces filipinensis. It is structurally related to kirromycin, aurodox and efrotomycin.</owl:annotatedTarget>
