        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A narrow spectrum antibiotic effective against  Clostridioides difficile infection (CDI). It is active against gram positive and gram negative bacteria by inhibiting RNA polymerase&apos;s switch region leading to cell death.</owl:annotatedTarget>
