        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The MdtG protein, also named YceE, appears to be a member of the major facilitator superfamily of transporters, and it has been reported, when overexpressed, to increase fosfomycin and deoxycholate resistances. mdtG is a member of the marA-soxS-rob regulon.</owl:annotatedTarget>
