        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An enzyme that confers resistance to fosfomycin in Escherichia coli by breaking the epoxide ring of the molecule. It depends on the cofactors Manganese (II) and Potassium and uses Glutathione (GSH) as the nucleophilic molecule.</obo:IAO_0000115>
