        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Teixobactin is a peptide antibiotic isolated from the Gram-negative bacteria, Eleftheria terrae. It inhibits the synthesis of peptidoglycan by interacting with peptidoglycan precursor, Lipid II and Lipid III.</obo:IAO_0000115>
