        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The liaFSR system regulates the cell envelope stress response. It is transcriptionally activated by exposure to alkaline shock, detergents, and particularly antibiotics with lipid II inhibition properties.</obo:IAO_0000115>
