        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">RNA polymerase is a multisubunit enzyme that is necessary for transcription. The beta prime subunit of RNA polymerase forms the active center of the enzyme and template/transcript binding sites. Mutations in rpoC gene confers antibiotic resistance.</obo:IAO_0000115>
