        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Point mutations in Streptococcus pyogenes dihydropteroate synthase folP prevent sulfonamide antibiotics from inhibiting its role in folate synthesis, thus conferring sulfonamide resistance.</obo:IAO_0000115>
