        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">pncA is a pyrazinamidase/nicotinamidase. It catalyzes the activation of pyrazinamide. Some mutation within pncA are associated with loss of enzyme activity, resulting in pyrazinamide resistance.</obo:IAO_0000115>
