        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A foreign PBP2 acquired by lateral gene transfer that able to perform peptidoglycan synthesis in the presence of beta-lactams.</obo:IAO_0000115>
