        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ethA is a monooxygenase that is able to convert a wide range of ketones to the corresponding esters or lactones via a Baeyer-Villiger oxidation reaction. Is responsible for the activation of several thiocarbamide-containing pro-drugs into cytotoxic species.</obo:IAO_0000115>
