        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">It Catalyzes the 2&apos;-O-methylation at nucleotides C1409 in 16S rRNA and C1920 in 23S rRNA.</obo:IAO_0000115>
