        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">BasRS is a two-component regulatory system. BasR is phosphorylated by BasS at high[Fe3+] levels. The BasRS system regulates the expression of pmrE, pmrF and pmrC, leading to antibiotic resistance.</obo:IAO_0000115>
