        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ADC beta-lactamases, also known as AmpC beta-lactamases, are cephalosporinases with extended-spectrum resistance to cephalosporins but not to carbapenems. ADC beta-lactamases are found in Acinetobacter sp. and Oligella urethralis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
