        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Point mutations to the active importer GlpT, which is involved with the uptake of many phosphorylated sugars, confer resistance to fosfomycin by reducing import of the drug into the bacteria.</obo:IAO_0000115>
