        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Palmitic acid is the most common saturated fatty acid found in animals, plants, and microorganisms. Palmitic acid is found to have antibacterial properties.</owl:annotatedTarget>
