        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Gentamicin A is part of a complex of broad spectrum aminoglycoside antibiotics. Gentamicin inhibits protein synthesis, resulting in bacterial cell death.</owl:annotatedTarget>
