        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Methyltransferase enzyme first described in Streptoalloteichus tenebrarius. Confers resistance to aminoglycoside antibiotics (esp. apramycin) through methylation of the 16S rRNA at A1408, thereby modifying the antibiotic target.</obo:IAO_0000115>
