        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A category of aminoglycoside O-nucleotidyltransferase enzymes with modification regiospecificity based at the 2&apos;&apos;-hydroxyl group of the respective antibiotic. These enzymes inactivate aminoglycoside antibiotics by transfer of an AMP group from an ATP substrate to the 2&apos;&apos;-hydroxyl group of the compound.</owl:annotatedTarget>
