        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Members of the Sugar Porin family tend to facilitate the transport of maltodextrins and other sugars across the outer membrane of Gram-negative bacteria. These porins form a homotrimeric structure.</obo:IAO_0000115>
