        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">These are GBPs that are associated with decreased susceptibility to beta-lactams either through mutations in the porin protein, absence of the porin protein, or expression of the porin protein.</obo:IAO_0000115>
