        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A class A beta-lactamase described in Acidaminococcus fermentans. ACI-1 was the first description of a beta-lactamase enzyme in a gram-negative anaerobic cocci. Described by Galan et al 2000.</owl:annotatedTarget>
