        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A method to determine microbial susceptibility to antibiotics in which test bacteria is inoculated onto an agar plate that contains a concentration gradient of antibiotic. The minimum inhibitory concentration of antibiotic is assessed.</obo:IAO_0000115>
