        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Cefsulodin is a third generation cephalosporin with with activity against Pseudomonas spp., but little activity against other Gram-negative  bacteria.</obo:IAO_0000115>
