        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Carumonam is a monobactam antibiotic. It has activity towards Gram-negative bacteria with negligible activity towards Gram-postitive bacteria.</obo:IAO_0000115>
