        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">parRS is a two-component sensor that mediates MexXY/OprM and porin OprD to confer resistance to polycationic antibiotics. It has multiple mechanisms of resistance such as LPS modification, efflux mediation and reduced porin pathway.</obo:IAO_0000115>
