        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FosA7.5 is a variant of the FosA7 gene. This gene is unique from FosA7 in that it is found in Escherichia coli as opposed to Salmonella enterica. It confers resistance to fosfomycin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
