        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Alkaloids are naturally occurring organic compounds containing the element nitrogen. Some alkaloid compounds exhibit specific antibacterial activity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
