        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A metallophore is any organic substance capable of carrying a metallic element such as zinc or iron, typically through chelation. Some metallophores exhibit specific antibiotic activity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
