        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">PFM-4 (BioF) is a class B2 metallo-beta-lactamase first identified in Pseudomonas. It belongs to the PFM-like beta-lactamase gene family. It confers resistance to carbapenems and some cephalosporins.</owl:annotatedTarget>
