        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Risedronate is a bisphosphonate used as an oral medication to treat osteoperosis and Paget&apos;s disease of bone. It has been shown to inhibit the action of New Delhi metallo-beta-lactamase-1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
