        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Methotrexate is an antifolate chemotherapeutic and immune suppressant used to treat a wide variety of cancers and autoimmune diseases. It has been shown to inhibit the action of New Delhi metallo-beta-lactamase-1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
