        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Ornidazole is a synthetic nitroimidazole derivative mainly used to treat parasitic infections but has also demonstrated antibiotic activity against anaerobic bacteria.</obo:IAO_0000115>
