        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Avilamycin is an experimental oligosaccharide antibiotic of the orthosomycin group of orthoester antibiotics. Along with evernimicin, it exhibits activity against a variety of Gram-positive and -negative bacteria.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">PMID:27330110</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
