        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Helicase-like proteins that confer resistance to antibiotics such as rifamycins by preventing or disrupting their binding to RNA polymerase.</owl:annotatedTarget>
