        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Quercetin is a common plant flavonoid that has shown inhibitory activity against certain aminoglycoside inactivation enzymes. Quercetin is also able to inhibit antbiotic efflux pumps such as AcrAB-TolC.</obo:IAO_0000115>
