        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Pterostilbene is a stilbenoid compound with antioxidant effects found in members of the genus Vaccinium (blueberries). It has also been shown to partially inhibit the mobile colistin resistance gene MCR-1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
