        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Baicalin is a flavonoid compound that is able to inhibit the activity of tetK and MsrA antibiotic efflux pumps. It is also able to inhibit the formation of bacterial biofilms and disrupt quorum sensing.</obo:IAO_0000115>
