        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">SUL-DUR or sulbactam-durlobactam (formerly ETX2514SUL) is a novel beta-lactam-beta-lactamase inhibitor designed specifically for the treatment of carbapenem-resistant Acinetobacter baumannii (CRAB).</obo:IAO_0000115>
