        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Sulfamerazine is a sulfonamide anti-infective used to treat bacterial infections, such as bronchitis, prostatitis, and urinary tract infections.</obo:IAO_0000115>
