        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ATP synthase enzymes, specifically subunit C, resistant to diarylquinolone antibiotics including Bedaquiline. Mutations in ATP synthase confer antibiotic resistance by disrupting binding and blocking of ATP synthase reactions by Bedaquiline.</obo:IAO_0000115>
