        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">TBI-223 is a novel oxazolidinone with potentially reduced myelosuppression, compared to linezolid. TBI-223 may be considered an additional treatment against MRSA infections and potentially other Gram-positive bacteria in humans.</obo:IAO_0000115>
