        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Monensin is an ionophore antibiotic isolated from Streptomyces cinnamonensis with very strong antibacterial and antiparasitic effects.</obo:IAO_0000115>
