        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Clotrimazole is a type of imidazole antibiotic, particularly antifungal. It is mostly used for the treatment of tinea pedis,  vulvovaginal and oropharyngeal candidiasis. It has broad activity against Candida albicans and other fungal infections.</obo:IAO_0000115>
