        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Miconazole is a type of imidazole antibiotic, particularly antifungal. It is used to treat oral and vaginal yeast infections, as well as mucosal thrush.</obo:IAO_0000115>
