        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Flumequine is a first generation fluoroquinolone antibiotic. It is used primarily for the treatment of enteric infections in domestic species. It has been removed from clinical use and is no longer being marketed.</obo:IAO_0000115>
