        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Arsinothricin is a natural product synthesized by the rhizosphere bacterium Burkholderia gladioli GSRB05 and is a broad-spectrum antibiotic effective against human pathogens such as carbapenem-resistant Enterobacter cloacae. It is a non-proteogenic amino acid and glutamate mimetic that inhibits bacterial glutamine synthetase.</obo:IAO_0000115>
