            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FUR1 is a fungal uracil phosphoribosyltransferase in Candida spp. It encodes the UPRT protein, also known as uracil pyrophosphorylase, which is a key regulating enzyme in pyrimidine salvage. Mutations in FUR1 have been shown to confer resistance to 5-flucytosine.</obo:IAO_0000115>
