        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">PSZ-1 is a PSZ beta-lactamase found in Pantoea endophytica. The gene showed resistance to penicillins and several first-, second-and third-generation cephalosporins as well as aztreonam.</obo:IAO_0000115>
