        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CDA-1 was recovered from a urine sample and is intermediate or resistant to third-generation cephalosporins and carbapenems. Susceptibility testing, isoelectric focusing, and analysis of outer membrane proteins showed that AmpC beta-lactamase expression combined with porin deficiency accounted for the carbapenem resistance.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CDA-1</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
