        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FCY2 encodes for purine-cytosine permease in fungal cells. Downregulation or absence of FCY2 confers resistance to antibiotics by preventing entry into the cell.</obo:IAO_0000115>
